s service company -> description and services pages"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "All About Electronics specializes in computer repair and offers a wide variety of additional services including, but not limited to, system backups, networking solutions, iPhone or tablet screen replacements, plus refurbished computer sales", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='all-about-electronics' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='All European Auto Supply operates from Ferndale, Michigan, supplying genuine, original-equipment and OEM replacement parts for European vehicle lines including BMW, Volkswagen, Mercedes-Benz, Mini, Audi, Porsche, Land Rover, Saab and Fiat. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

The business functions as a wholesale distributor, stocking brands such as Brembo braking components, Febi Bilstein chassis and timing parts, Valeo lighting and electrical systems, DENSO ignition products and Professional Parts Sweden. Its e-commerce platform provides VIN-based lookup, a multiple-part search tool and a business-account portal that unlocks tiered pricing. Orders of ten or more line items qualify for an additional 3% large-order discount on top of bulk-deal pricing.

The company publishes technical articles — covering topics such as chassis-mount diagnostics, timing-chain failure analysis on BMW N47 engines and spark-plug selection — to support installer decision-making.

All European emphasizes fast shipping, expert phone support and a warehouse culture built on cross-training rather than high-pressure metrics, positioning itself as a parts partner rather than a transactional reseller.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["European vehicle parts distribution", "VIN-based parts identification", "Wholesale/B2B account management", "Bulk order processing", "Contact-free locker pickup", "Technical support content publishing", "Multi-brand catalog management"], "industries": ["Automotive aftermarket", "European vehicle repair", "Wholesale distribution", "Collision repair"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Location: Ferndale, Michigan -> db", "Distributes genuine/OE/OEM parts for BMW, VW, Mercedes, Mini, Audi, Porsche, Land Rover, Saab, Fiat -> /", "Official distributor of Brembo braking products -> /", "Carries Febi Bilstein, Valeo, DENSO, Professional Parts Sweden brands -> /", "Offers VIN lookup for parts identification -> /", "Provides B2B wholesale accounts with bulk pricing -> /", "Large order discount: 3% off orders of 10+ items -> /", "Contact-free locker pickup available -> /", "Publishes technical articles (tech tips) on European vehicle repair -> /", "Warehouse cross-training culture mentioned in hiring post -> /", "Facebook social media presence -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "All European is excited to announce that we are now an official distributor of Brembo braking products.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "10 items for bulk discount eligibility", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": ["Facebook"], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='all-european-auto-supply' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='All Metal Fabricators Inc was founded in 1976 and operates from Acton, Massachusetts The company does not disclose its ownership structure or founder names in the available materials.

