UPDATE companies SET description='All Metal Manufacturing operates from Rapid City, South Dakota, where it has served the Black Hills region since 1987. The family-owned business began in a small garage under founder Tim Burke and has grown to a staff of over 35 employees at its current location on Universal Drive, with a shop expansion underway to accommodate rising demand.

The company provides a full range of metal fabrication services, including ornamental railings, metal and spiral staircases, and custom iron works such as drive gates and electric gate closures.

All Metal serves commercial and private construction projects throughout the Black Hills, working closely with local contractors and a base of repeat customers.

