UPDATE companies SET description='All Steel Fabricators Inc. operates from West Valley City, Utah, where it has been a family-owned business since its founding in 1974. The company was established to serve Utah businesses with a range of steel and metal fabrication services.

The shop provides a broad suite of fabrication processes, including plasma cutting, plate burning, water jet cutting, shearing (22 gauge to 3/8 inch thick, up to 12 feet wide), forming (same thickness and width), pipe rolling (1/2 to 2 inches), plate rolling (1/4 inch by 8 feet), hole punching (up to 1-9/16 inch), angle rolling (1/4 x 2 x 2 inches), and flat bar rolling (up to 1/2 x 3 inches, easy and hard way).

The company serves businesses across Utah, though specific industry sectors or named customers are not listed in its public materials.

