UPDATE companies SET description='Alliance Auto Body Parts operates from Houston, Texas, where it has served the greater Houston area for over two decades. The company was established as a supplier of new replacement auto body parts, though the exact founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

The business distributes a broad range of auto body components, including bumpers, fenders, hoods, fans, grilles and valances, cooling products, and lighting products. It supports most major vehicle brands and maintains two locations in Houston, which the company says enables greater convenience and faster deliveries for customers.

Testimonials on the company’s website cite a national auto sales company, a repair shop owner from Cypress, Texas, and a buyer from Monez Auto as examples of clients who rely on Alliance for both standard stock and hard-to-find special orders.

Alliance emphasizes accurate, friendly service, competitive pricing, and faster delivery as its core differentiators. The company highlights its willingness to “go the extra mile” to arrange buy-outs and special orders, and it promotes its two-location footprint as a unique advantage in the Houston market for reducing lead times.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Auto body parts distribution", "Special orders and buy-outs", "Multi-location inventory and delivery"], "industries": ["Collision repair", "Automotive aftermarket", "General consumers", "Commercial auto sales"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Only supplier in Houston with two locations for faster delivery", "Accurate, friendly service", "Competitive pricing", "Willingness to handle buy-outs and special orders"], "facts_used": ["Houston, Texas headquarters -> db", "Over 20 years in business -> /about", "Supplier of new replacement auto body parts -> /about", "Two locations in Houston -> /about", "Product lines: bumpers, fenders, hoods, fans, grilles & valances, cooling products, lighting products, other products -> /", "Supports most car brands -> /", "Serves collision repair industry and general public -> /", "Customer testimonials: Ms. Vicki (Cypress, TX), Mr. Daron (Parts Manager, national auto sales), Mr. Willie (Monez Auto) -> /about", "Differentiators: accurate friendly service, competitive pricing, faster delivery, buy-outs and special orders -> /, /about", "Company type: distributor/reseller -> inferred from description"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We are the leading supplier of new replacement auto body parts in the greater Houston area.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='alliance-auto-bo