UPDATE companies SET description='Alpine Consulting & Metal Works was founded in 2018 by Joseph Poulin in Oakland, Maine. Poulin, who holds a BS in Mechanical Engineering Technology from the University of Maine at Orono, established the company to provide custom metal fabrication, engineering solutions, and process consulting.

The shop delivers structural steel fabrication, welding (including AWS-certified FCAW), and industrial, mechanical, and pipe fabrication. It also offers engineering support, project management, and fabrication software consulting for platforms such as STSX and Tekla PowerFab. Projects have ranged from 500‑pound custom jobs to 4,000‑ton structural builds.

Customers include steel fabrication firms such as Cherokee Steel Inc. (Watertown, TN) and Ennis Steel (Ennis, TX), along with other industrial and mechanical contractors seeking process optimization and on‑site field engineering. The company serves a broad base of structural steel, industrial fabrication, and pipe fabrication sectors.

ACMW emphasizes a seamless customer experience backed by Poulin’s hands‑on background from shop floor to engineering leadership. The firm differentiates itself by offering versatile solutions — whether on the shop floor, in the office, or on‑site as a field engineer — and by guiding clients in streamlining workflows through fabrication software consulting.', certifications=ARRAY['AWS FCAW Certification']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Structural steel fabrication", "Welding (FCAW)", "Industrial fabrication", "Mechanical fabrication", "Pipe fabrication", "Engineering support", "Process consulting", "Fabrication software consulting", "Project management", "Custom metal fabrication", "Heavy structural metal fabrication", "Miscellaneous metal fabrication"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "500 lb to 4,000 tons", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["AWS-certified FCAW welding", "Fabrication software consulting (STSX, Tekla PowerFab)", "Project scale from 500 lb to 4,000 tons", "On-site field engineering support", "Custom metal fabrication tailored to unique specifications"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2018 -> /about", "Founder Joseph Poulin -> /about", "Founder education: BS Mechanical Engineering Technology, University of Maine at Orono -> /about", "Headquarters: Oakland, Maine -> /, /about", "Services: custom metal fabrication, engineering solutions, process consulting -> /, /about", "AWS Certification in FCAW (Flux Core Arc Welding) -> /about", "Project scale: 500-lb custom jobs to 4,000-ton structural projects -> /about", "Testimonial from Alex King, Cherokee Steel Inc., Watertown TN -> /", "Testimonial from Ricky Devora, Ennis Steel, Ennis TX -> /", "Fabrication software consulting for STSX and Tekla PowerFab -> /", "Engineering support and project management -> /, /about", "Industrial, mechanical, and pipe fabrication -> /about", "On-site field engineering support -> /about", "Founder experience: shop floor to enginee