UPDATE companies SET description='Amtech Systems, Inc. (ASYS) is headquartered in Albuquerque, New Mexico. Founded in 1981, the company operates as a global supplier of semiconductor equipment and materials through four wholly-owned subsidiaries: BTU International, Entrepix Inc., PR Hoffman™, and Intersurface Dynamics.

The company designs, manufactures, and sells capital equipment and consumables for semiconductor fabrication, advanced packaging, and electronics assembly. Its portfolio spans substrate processing — including lapping, polishing, cleaning, etching, and chemical mechanical planarization (CMP) — as well as thermal processing with belt furnaces, diffusion furnaces, and reflow ovens. Operations span eight locations in five countries.

Amtech serves the power semiconductor market across mobile, computing, industrial, automotive, telecom, and medical sectors. Its customers include integrated circuit fabricators, original equipment manufacturers, materials suppliers, defense contractors, and outsourced semiconductor assembly and test (OSAT) providers. The company''s high-volume reflow ovens are used by OSATs and OEMs for advanced packaging of AI semiconductor devices, while its CMP services support major IC fabricators and materials suppliers.

The company cites product quality and customer service as its primary differentiators, positioning itself as a supplier of high-quality solutions. Its growth strategy centers on the silicon carbide and power semiconductor sectors, aiming to maximize revenue through optimization of existing businesses, rationalization of product lines, leveraging corporate capabilities, and strategic acquisitions.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Chemical Mechanical Planarization (CMP) services", "CMP consumables supply", "CMP equipment refurbishment", "OnTrak cleaner manufacturing", "Lapping", "Polishing", "Cleaning and etching", "Belt furnace manufacturing", "Diffusion furnace manufacturing", "Reflow oven manufacturing", "Solder reflow equipment for advanced packaging", "TrueFlat solder reflow for ultra-thin substrates", "Semiconductor fabrication equipment", "Advanced packaging equipment", "Electronics assembly equipment", "Substrate processing", "Thermal processing", "Obsolescence solutions for CMP equipment", "Electro-mechanical system design", "Aerospace defense contracting"], "industries": ["Mobile", "Computing", "Industrial", "Automotive", "Telecom", "Medical", "Power semiconductors", "Integrated circuit fabrication", "Original equipment manufacturers (OEMs)", "Materials suppliers", "Defense contracting", "Outsourced semiconductor assembly and test (OSAT)", "Artificial intelligence semiconductors"], "materials": ["Silicon", "Silicon Carbide"], "equipment": ["OnTrak cleaners", "TrueFlat solder reflow systems", "Belt furnaces", "Diffusion furnaces", "Reflow ovens"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Product quality and customer service as primary differentiators", "Four wholly-owned subsidiaries with premier brand names", "World''s largest CMP technology portfolio via Entrepix", "Differentiated TrueFlat solder reflow for ultra-thin substrates", "Focus on silicon carbide and power semiconductor growth sectors"], "facts_us