UPDATE companies SET description='Anchor Ingredients is a privately owned specialty ingredient supplier headquartered in Fargo, North Dakota. Established as a link between agricultural producers and food brands, the company has grown into a coast-to-coast network with offices, manufacturing facilities, and warehouses across the United States.

