UPDATE companies SET description='Arcco Power Systems is based in Baton Rouge, Louisiana, where it operates as a generator sales, service, rental, and parts provider. The company focuses on diesel, natural gas, and bi-fuel generators ranging from 10 kW to 3.2 MW in both stationary and portable configurations.

