UPDATE companies SET description='Arkansas Glass Container Corporation has operated from the same property in Jonesboro, Arkansas since 1948. The facility was originally built to produce minnow-roach bait traps; a change in ownership and company name in the mid-1950s redirected production to food-grade glass containers, a line that continues today. The company describes itself as American owned.

